106 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 50 0 R
/E (Graham Olu was born in 2001 to the Late David Lwangu Barasa, the Late Josephine Akello Ogola and the Late Lydia Wanja Mate. He grew up alongside his siblings Baron Barasa, Ann Imbuga, Esther Atieno, Victor Gitonga and Humphrey Mutugi with whom he shared a close bond and a common heritage. Both his parents went before him, but the foundation they laid for their children lived on in Graham and his siblings, and remains part of the legacy he leaves behind. Graham and his siblings easily integrated into the Mate family in Kanyuambora, Embu County where they are cherished members.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
