111 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 50 0 R
/E (and later to Kanyuambora Boys High School for his secondary education. It was in these years that his curiosity, especially about how things work, began to take shape.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
112 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 50 0 R
/E (Graham loved to learn, and technology held his attention above all. While still in his teens he trained in ethical hacking at the Zalego Institute of Technology and Innovation \(2019-2020\), and went on to Cisco Networking Academy, where he trained for the Cisco Certified Network Associate \(CCNA\) certification \(2020-2021\). In January 2021 he enrolled at Zetech University to study Software Engineering, and pursued the degree until November 2024. Alongside it, he studied web development at Codesmith \(2022-2023\) and undertook a Fullstack Developer programme at Holberton School \(2023-2024\). His learning was not confined to technology. Between December 2023 and April 2024 he studied for a Certificate in Kenyan Sign Language at the Kenya Institute of Special Education, a reminder that his interest in communication reached well beyond code.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
