116 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 51 0 R
/E (Graham built his career in software engineering, artificial intelligence and emerging technologies, and in a short time he took on real responsibility. From October 2022 to December 2025 he served as a Legislative Intern at the County Assembly of Kiambu, contributing to research and policy work on emerging technologies and their social and economic effects. Between March and November 2025 he served as Chief Technology Officer of DalensAI and as Tech Lead at MeallensAI, shaping technical architecture and building AI-driven products. From September 2025 to March 2026 he was Treasurer of Based Creators East Africa, supporting financial planning, treasury management and digital asset security. Earlier, from November 2023 to November 2024, he served as a crew member at Droidcon Kenya, part of the technology community he valued.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
117 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 51 0 R
/E (His career was still unfolding, yet he had already webbed together associates and teams in technology, research, leadership and community service. It was the path of a young man still learning, still building, and still asking how his skills could serve others.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
