119 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 51 0 R
/E (Graham was raised in the Christian faith and was baptized and confirmed in the Anglican Church. Graham would later changed his own path by nurturing a desire to enter catholic priesthood. Quietly, Graham had deeply integrated into the Catholic faith and was an active member of his Jumuia. As we gather to remember him, it is that same faith in God, and the prayers and hope it carries, that will sustain those he has left behind. We can only thank God for Graham.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
